le=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//RtmpUrzqyS/downloaded_packages/colorspace_1.2-4.tgz’ is not an OS X binary package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;tar&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> returned non</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">zero </span><span style=\"color:#008\">exit</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> code </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span></div></code></div><br>I don&#39;t know how to go about determining what to check or fix.<br><br>Any help or suggestions to get me going are appreciated.<br><br>Thanks in advance.<br></div>"
